  "containers": {
    "passiveCard": "<div id=\"card-sec-1\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-1\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\" class=\"\">Activates the Entrance Animation when there is another \"Terrifying Conquerors\" Category ally on the team upon the character's entry</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-1\"><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">ATK &amp; DEF 300%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">, guards all attacks and launches an additional Super Attack for 6 turns</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Extreme Class allies' Ki +2 and ATK 100%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">for 3 turns</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-2\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-2\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">Basic effect(s)</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-2\"><li>Ki +6</li><li class=\"\">ATK &amp; DEF 300%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li class=\"\">Damage reduction rate up 60%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li>Receives an additional Ki +2 per Ki Sphere obtained</li><li>Launches an additional attack that has a great chance of becoming a Super Attack</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-3\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-3\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">For every attack received or evaded</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-3\"><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">DEF 50%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">(up to 300%)</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Chance of performing a critical hit &amp; chance of evading enemy's attack 10%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">(up to 50%)</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-4\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-4\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">When there is a Super Class enemy</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-4\"><li>ATK &amp; DEF 200%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li>Foresees enemy's Super Attack</li><li>Attack effective against all types</li><li>Launches two additional Super Attacks</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-5\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-5\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">When activating the Active Skill or when attacking with 20 or more Ki</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-5\"><li>ATK 200%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li>Chance of performing critical hit 50%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-6\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-6\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">For every attack that the character is targeted by when HP is above 50%</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-6\"><li>DEF 60%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-7\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-7\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">After receiving an attack as the 2nd or 3rd attacker in a turn</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-7\"><li>DEF 100%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">once for 2 turns</li><li>Launches an addtional Attack that has a great chance of becoming a Super Attack for 2 turns</li><li>\"Terrifying Conquerors\" Category allies' DEF 100%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">and damage reduction rate 5%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">for 2 turns</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-8\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-8\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">When the character is KO'd</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-8\" class=\"\"><li class=\"\"><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">ATK 300%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Guards all attacks</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Revives with 50% HP</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-9\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-9\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\" class=\"\">When receiving a Ki Blast Super Attack</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-9\"><li>Nullifies it, ATK 400%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"> temporarily and counters with tremendous power when facing an super class enemy</li><li>Great chance of nullifying it, ATK 300%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"> temporarily and countering with tremendous power</li></ul></div>",
